          "key": "total",
          "label": "common.col.total",
          "type": "currency",
          "currency": {
            "codeKey": "currency"
          }
        }
      ],
      "readOnlyReason": "a purchase order carries its lines, and a receipt names lines, batches and quantities; a flat form cannot express either, so this resource lists rather than creates (the createPurchaseOrder and receivePurchaseOrder actions do). A dedicated page is the fix, not a schema field."
    }
